/T (The focus of our chair is on combining sculptural aesthetics with comfort and usability. By using earthy materials and nature-inspired forms, the design aims to create a strong visual impact while maintaining functionality. The chair is not just a seating element but a representation of culture, nature, and modern design thinking.)
/E (The focus of our chair is on combining sculptural aesthetics with comfort and usability. By using earthy materials and nature-inspired forms, the design aims to create a strong visual impact while maintaining functionality. The chair is not just a seating element but a representation of culture, nature, and modern design thinking.)
